// Regional-email helper (checklist item 1): the "total reviews per unit & area" figure,
// all regions in one result sorted by region, ready to copy-paste per region.
//
// Thin projection over GloCo_CaseReview_AreaCounts — drops the per-week columns and keeps
// Region / Area / Total plus the synthetic "{Region}, Total" rows. "Total" = distinct cases
// submitted (case-review submissions UNION triage) attributed to the submitter's area, since
// launch to today. Called by name (single saved-search reference) to avoid the resolver clash
// documented in GloCo_PageViews / GloCo__AreaRegionMapping.
//
// Caveats (see email-reproduction-checklist.md): reviewer-area attribution (not case area), so
// high-unit reviewers collapse into CPSD and blank-area into Unmapped; triage only from
// 2026-06-01. Numbers approximate the backend's case-area figures, they don't match exactly.
GloCo_CaseReview_AreaCounts
| project Region, Area, Total
